OL,3,GNEWSAAcquitted 'China spy' tells BBC: I
OL,4,Awas fall guy for security services but
OL,5,Aalso naive
OL,6,
OL,7,FA British man who was charged with
OL,8,Fspying for China has told the BBC he
OL,9,Fwas a "convenient fall guy" for UK
OL,10,Fpolice and security services who wanted
OL,11,Fto put espionage threats by foreign
OL,12,Fstates "on the map".
OL,14,FChris Cash, a former parliamentary
OL,15,Fresearcher, has shared more than 6,000
OL,16,Fmessages with us revealing how a
OL,17,FChinese official sought information
OL,18,Fabout sensitive political matters in
OL,19,Fthe UK - including the 2022 Tory
OL,20,Fleadership battle to decide the next
OL,21,Fprime minister.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
