OL,3,GNEWSAAcquitted 'China spy' tells BBC: I
OL,4,Awas fall guy for security services but
OL,5,Aalso naive
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe messages show how Cash's friend in
OL,8,FChina, Chris Berry - with whom he had
OL,9,Fbeen sharing information - dramatically
OL,10,Fdescribed a "secret" meeting between
OL,11,FBerry and a high-ranking Chinese
OL,12,Fofficial.
OL,14,FBerry said he had been told that China
OL,15,Fwas concerned about how a British MP it
OL,16,Fhad sanctioned might be promoted to a
OL,17,Fcabinet role.
